<DocsLayout
  title="WinuxCmd — native Unix commands for Windows"
  description="WinuxCmd product page: a single native Win32 executable carrying 176 Unix commands / 1,924 options — 3.79 MB, ~19 ms cold start, PGO builds; 93% pass on a 178-case differential against GNU coreutils 9.7; built-in wpm package manager; zero-glue PATH injection with niubash."
  path="/en/products/winuxcmd/"
  lang="en"
  enPath="/products/winuxcmd/"
  jsonLdExtra={productJsonLd}
  ogImage="/og/winuxcmd.png"
  zhBanner
>
  <header class="doc-head">
    <h1>WinuxCmd: native Unix commands for Windows</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      One native Win32 executable that speaks GNU syntax and walks real Windows paths:
      <strong>176 commands, 1,924 options, a single 3.79 MB file</strong>. No WSL, no Cygwin, no
      MSYS2, no path-translation pain — it is the command half of the
      <a href="/en/products/niubash/">niubash</a> workflow: the shell provides the language,
      WinuxCmd provides the commands.
    </p>
    <div class="badge-row">
      <Badge text="C++23" tone="accent" />
      <Badge text="Windows x64 · ARM64" tone="info" />
      <Badge text={latest || 'v1.1.15'} tone="warn" />
      <Badge text="MIT" tone="muted" />
    </div>
    <p class="repo-line">
      <a href="https://github.com/unixwin/WinuxCmd" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        github.com/unixwin/WinuxCmd ↗
      </a>
      {stars !== null && <span class="stars">{stars} stars</span>}
      <span class="src">(repo-meta.json, measured 2026-10-19)</span>
    </p>
  </header>

  <section>
    <h2>Why WinuxCmd</h2>
    <p>
      Typing <code>grep -rn</code>, <code>sed -i</code>, <code>find -exec</code>,
      <code>xargs -0</code> on Windows used to mean choosing a compromise. WinuxCmd's stance is to
      skip the compromise: it does not emulate Unix — it implements GNU's invocation surface on Win32.
    </p>
    <details class="zh-fold">
      <summary>中文原文 · Chinese original（4 张对照卡全文）</summary>
      <div lang="zh-CN">
        <ul>
          <li><strong>不是虚拟机</strong>（vs WSL）——WSL 给你 1 GB+ 安装与一道 VM 文件系统边界；WinuxCmd 是一个原生 Win32 可执行文件，直接操作你的真实文件。</li>
          <li><strong>不是模拟层</strong>（vs Cygwin）——Cygwin 要你做路径翻译体操、付 2–5 秒启动；WinuxCmd 理解 C:\ 与 UNC 原生形态，冷启动约 19 ms，无运行时 DLL。</li>
          <li><strong>不是 2012 年的遗物</strong>（vs GnuWin32）——GnuWin32 停止维护于 2012 年、兼容度停在 60%；WinuxCmd 的差分语料 178 例对 GNU coreutils 9.7 oracle 实测 93% 通过。</li>
          <li><strong>不止 ~100 命令</strong>（vs uutils）——同为原生命令集的 uutils 覆盖约 100 命令 / ~600 选项；WinuxCmd 携带 176 命令 / 1,924 选项，单文件 3.79 MB。</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </details>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Core features</h2>
    <p>
      Native rather than emulated (Win32 APIs, C:\ and UNC paths, NTFS ACLs); the critical GNU bits
      delivered (<code>find</code> with 88 options, <code>grep</code> with 49 incl. PCRE2, in-place
      <code>sed -i</code>); dual-dialect paths; i18n message catalogues; zero-glue niubash
      integration; PGO release builds. Full eight-point list (Chinese):
    </p>
    <details class="zh-fold">
      <summary>中文原文 · Chinese original（八条特性全文）</summary>
      <div lang="zh-CN">
        <ul>
          <li><strong>原生而非模拟</strong>——直接调用 Win32 API：理解 C:\、D:/、UNC 路径与 NTFS ACL（配 cygpath / getfacl 桥接），无 VM、无运行时 DLL、即时启动。</li>
          <li><strong>GNU 关键位全给</strong>——find 一个命令实现 88 个选项（完整表达式解析器、-exec/-execdir/-ok/-printf）；grep 49 选项含 PCRE2；sed 支持就地 -i 编辑。</li>
          <li><strong>176 命令 / 1,924 选项</strong>——Coreutils 83 + findutils/grep/sed + BSD 工具 15 + 进程管理 13 + Cygwin/MSYS 桥 14 + 系统信息 16 + 自有扩展 10+。</li>
          <li><strong>wpm 内建</strong>——不该重造的工具（jq、ripgrep、fd、fzf、bat、make、neovim、curl、wget…）用内建包管理器一键装真发行版。</li>
          <li><strong>双方言路径</strong>——POSIX 写法（/d/repo、/cygdrive/d、/mnt/d）与 Windows 原生写法（D:\repo）全部接受且真实折叠。</li>
          <li><strong>中文输出（i18n）</strong>——消息目录经 wpm 安装（winuxcmd-i18n-zh-cn），WINUX_LANG 优先、回落 LC_ALL/LC_MESSAGES/LANG。</li>
          <li><strong>与 niubash 零胶水</strong>——niubash 启动时把 WinuxCmd 的命令链接注入 PATH——shell 里敲的 grep/sed/find 就是这枚二进制。</li>
          <li><strong>PGO 发布档</strong>——公开 x64 二进制按真实负载做 Profile-Guided Optimization 训练：sort −18%、nl −17%。</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </details>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Install &amp; quick start</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>The niubash Windows installer ships a complete WinuxCmd root (preinstalled)</strong> —
      installed under <code>&#123;app&#125;\winuxcmd\</code> with PATH pointing at
      <code>winuxcmd\bin</code>; installing <a href="/en/products/niubash/">niubash</a> gives you all
      176 commands and built-in wpm. Standalone installs are for users without niubash: grab the
      installer from GitHub Releases (<code>WinuxCmd-&lt;version&gt;-x64-setup.exe</code>, plus ARM64
      and a portable zip); an existing installation self-updates via the built-in wpm — all three
      roads land on the same <code>winuxcmd.exe</code>.
    </p>
    <p class="cmd-label">Already have WinuxCmd? Update it with wpm (built into the binary itself):</p>
    <div class="codeblock">
      <pre class="cmd"><code>{updateSelf}</code></pre>
      <CopyButton copy={updateSelf} label="Copy" title="Copy to clipboard" />
    </div>
    <h3>First-run orientation</h3>
    <div class="codeblock">
      <pre class="cmd"><code>{firstRun}</code></pre>
      <CopyButton copy={firstRun} label="Copy" title="Copy to clipboard" />
    </div>
    <p>
      Chinese output: install the message catalogue and declare the language
      (<code>wpm install winuxcmd-i18n-zh-cn</code>, then <code>export WINUX_LANG=zh-CN</code>;
      without a catalogue, non-English locales get a one-line hint, #1155). Building from source
      needs VS 2022 + CMake 3.30 + Ninja, entry <code>scripts/build-with-vs.ps1</code>; reproduce PGO
      with <code>scripts/build-pgo.ps1</code>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Deep dive: command coverage and categories</h2>
    <p>
      The 176 commands are grouped coreutils-style (bare <code>winuxcmd</code> prints the grouped
      list; <code>--list-all</code> prints it flat); the 1,924-option total counts <code>OPTION(</code>
      macros under <code>src/commands/</code>, excluding the built-in wpm and the <code>[</code> alias.
    </p>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr><th>Category</th><th>Count</th><th>Representative commands</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {
          categories.map((r) => (
            <tr>
              <td><strong>{r.cat}</strong></td>
              <td>{r.count}</td>
              <td>{r.cmds}</td>
            </tr>
          ))
        }
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <p class="src-line">
      Source: the WinuxCmd README "Command coverage" (expandable full table) and
      <code>DOCS/en/command_compatibility_matrix.md</code> (per-command status for all 176).
    </p>
    <details class="zh-fold">
      <summary>中文原文 · Chinese original（差分测试 / i18n / PATH 注入 / 路径方言 四节全文）</summary>
      <div lang="zh-CN">
        <p><strong>差分测试：93% 是怎么来的</strong>——178 例差分语料（131 语料 + 47 回归，覆盖 84 个命令）以相同输入对 GNU coreutils 9.7、findutils 4.10.0、grep 3.12、sed 4.9、patch 2.7.6、util-linux 2.41、procps-ng 4.0.4 逐字节比对——165 例通过、13 例为实名在册的平台差异（93%），机器校验落在 tests/differential/baseline.json。13 例不是雾里的「有时不一样」：id -g 打印主组 RID、跨 \wsl.localhost 9p 的硬链、mkdir 报错引号形态。CI 里每个 PR 都对 GNU master 跑同一差分。</p>
        <p><strong>i18n 与 WINUX_LANG</strong>——语言选择器优先级：WINUX_LANG → LC_ALL → LC_MESSAGES → LANG（src/utils/i18n.cppm，#1155）；消息目录定位在安装根；WINUX_LANG=off 整体关闭。</p>
        <p><strong>与 niubash 的 PATH 注入联动</strong>——niu 启动时把 WinuxCmd 的命令链接注入 PATH；捆绑的 WinuxCmd coreutils「拥有 shell 树」（niubash#346 的 Windows 路径契约）——原样接收 shell 的 POSIX 写法并在子进程内自行解析，其余子进程一律收到原生 Windows 路径。</p>
        <p><strong>路径方言能力链</strong>——/d/repo（MSYS 单字母形）、/cygdrive/d（Cygwin 形，#1145）、/mnt/d（WSL 形按 interop 折叠，#1172）。方言 × 层的全量实测矩阵见 <a href="/en/docs/paths-and-msys/">路径与 MSYS</a>。</p>
      </div>
    </details>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Measured numbers</h2>
    <table>
      <thead>
