          <li><a href="https://github.com/unixwin/WinuxCmd/blob/master/DOCS/en/wpm_guide.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">wpm user guide ↗</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://github.com/unixwin/WinuxCmd/releases/latest" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Releases (installers / ARM64 / portable zip) ↗</a></li>
          <li><a href="/products/winuxcmd/" hreflang="zh-CN" lang="zh-CN">Chinese edition of this page</a></li>
